## 외부 REST API 호출 패턴 및 Outbound-Adapter 구조 탐색 결과

### 1. 현재 프로젝트의 외부 API 호출 패턴

프로젝트에는 **2가지 주요 외부 API 호출 패턴**이 구현되어 있습니다:

#### A. GraphQL API 호출 (Proxy API)
- **클라이언트**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/proxy-api/`
- **용도**: 쇼핑 관련 메타데이터(브랜드, 카테고리, 제조사, 쇼핑몰) 조회
- **HTTP 클라이언트**: WebClient 기반 `HttpGraphQlClient`
- **인증**: Basic Auth (username/password)
- **대상 시스템**: `dev-shopping-internal.danuricorp.com/graphql`

#### B. REST API 호출 (Keyword Analysis API)
- **클라이언트**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/keyword-analyzer/`
- **용도**: 한글 형태소 분석 및 키워드 토큰화
- **HTTP 클라이언트**: Spring RestClient (SimpleClientHttpRequestFactory 기반)
- **인증**: ApiKey (Authorization 헤더)
- **특징**: SSL 인증서 검증 비활성화 (자체서명 인증서 대응)
- **타임아웃**: 연결 5초, 읽기 5초
- **대상 시스템**: 분석 서비스 (darae-dev-grpc.danuricorp.com)

### 2. Hexagonal Architecture 구조

프로젝트는 **완벽한 Hexagonal Architecture**를 따르고 있습니다:

```
Domain Layer (순수 Kotlin, 프레임워크 의존성 없음)
├── /domain/proxy/
│   ├── brand/
│   │   ├── BrandRepository (Port 인터페이스)
│   │   ├── BrandService
│   │   └── Brand (Entity)
│   ├── category/
│   │   ├── CategoryRepository
│   │   ├── CategoryService
│   │   └── Category
│   ├── manufacturer/
│   │   ├── ManufacturerRepository
│   │   ├── ManufacturerService
│   │   └── Manufacturer
│   └── mall/
│       ├── MallRepository
│       ├── MallService
│       └── Mall
│
└── /domain/keyword/
    ├── KeywordAnalyzer (OutputPort 인터페이스)
    ├── KeywordAnalysisService
    └── KeywordAnalysisResult

Outbound-Adapter Layer (외부 시스템 연동)
├── /outbound-adapter/proxy/
│   ├── BrandRepositoryImpl (OutputPort 구현)
│   ├── CategoryRepositoryImpl
│   ├── ManufacturerRepositoryImpl
│   └── MallRepositoryImpl
│
└── /outbound-adapter/keyword/
    └── KeywordAnalyzerImpl (OutputPort 구현)

Outbound Client Layer (HTTP 클라이언트)
├── /outbound/client/proxy-api/
│   ├── ProxyApiClient (GraphQL 클라이언트)
│   ├── ProxyApiClientConfig (Bean 설정)
│   └── ProxyApiClientProperties (설정 프로퍼티)
│
└── /outbound/client/keyword-analyzer/
    ├── KeywordAnalysisClient (REST 클라이언트)
    ├── KeywordAnalysisConfig (Bean 설정)
    └── KeywordAnalysisClientProperties (설정 프로퍼티)

Application Layer
└── /application/index/service/
    └── ProxyApplicationService (비즈니스 로직, 병렬 호출 구현)
```

### 3. OutputPort 패턴 구현

**Domain Layer에서 인터페이스 정의:**

```kotlin
// /domain/proxy/brand/BrandRepository.kt
interface BrandRepository {
    fun findAllByIds(brandIds: List<Long>): List<Brand>
}

// /domain/proxy/category/CategoryRepository.kt
interface CategoryRepository {
    fun findAllByIds(categoryIds: List<Int>): List<Category>
}

// /domain/proxy/manufacturer/ManufacturerRepository.kt
interface ManufacturerRepository {
    fun findAllByIds(manufacturerIds: List<Long>): List<Manufacturer>
}

// /domain/proxy/mall/MallRepository.kt
interface MallRepository {
    fun findAllByIds(mallIds: List<Int>): List<Mall>
}

// /domain/keyword/KeywordAnalyzer.kt
interface KeywordAnalyzer {
    fun getTokenizedKeyword(
        keyword: String,
        filterStopword: Boolean,
        isExpandSynonym: Boolean,
        synonymMap: Boolean,
    ): KeywordAnalysisResult
}
```

**Outbound-Adapter에서 구현:**

```kotlin
// /outbound-adapter/proxy/BrandRepositoryImpl.kt
@Component
class BrandRepositoryImpl(
    private val client: ProxyApiClient,
) : BrandRepository {
    override fun findAllByIds(brandIds: List<Long>): List<Brand> {
        val query = """
            query GetBrands(${'$'}ids: [Long!]!) {
                brands(input: { ids: ${'$'}ids }) {
                    items { id, name }
                }
            }
        """
        return client.query(
            query = query,
            variables = mapOf("ids" to brandIds),
            retrievePath = "brands.items",
            classType = Brand::class.java,
        )
    }
}

// /outbound-adapter/keyword/KeywordAnalyzerImpl.kt
@Component
class KeywordAnalyzerImpl(
    private val keywordClient: KeywordAnalysisClient,
) : KeywordAnalyzer {
    override fun getTokenizedKeyword(
        keyword: String,
        filterStopword: Boolean,
        isExpandSynonym: Boolean,
        synonymMap: Boolean,
    ): KeywordAnalysisResult {
        val tokenizeKeyword = keywordClient.tokenizeKeyword(
            keyword = keyword,
            filterStopword = filterStopword,
            isExpandSynonym = isExpandSynonym,
        )
        return tokenizeKeyword.toKeywordAnalyzeResult()
    }
}
```

### 4. HTTP 클라이언트 설정

#### A. GraphQL 클라이언트 (ProxyApiClient)

**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/proxy-api/`

```kotlin
// ProxyApiClient.kt - GraphQL 쿼리 실행 클래스
@Component
class ProxyApiClient(
    @field:Qualifier("ProxyHttpGraphQlClient")
    private val client: HttpGraphQlClient
) {
    fun <T> query(
        query: String,
        variables: Map<String, Any> = emptyMap(),
        retrievePath: String,
        classType: Class<T>,
    ): List<T> {
        return try {
            client.document(query)
                .variables(variables)
                .retrieveSync(retrievePath)
                .toEntityList(classType)
        } catch (ex: Exception) {
            logger.error { ex }
            throw ex
        }
    }
}

// ProxyApiClientConfig.kt - WebClient 기반 설정
@Configuration
class ProxyApiClientConfig(
    private val prop: ProxyApiClientProperties,
) {
    @Bean("ProxyHttpGraphQlClient")
    fun httpGraphQlClient(): HttpGraphQlClient {
        return HttpGraphQlClient.builder(WebClient.create(prop.baseUrl))
            .headers { it.setBasicAuth(prop.username, prop.password) }
            .build()
    }
}

// ProxyApiClientProperties.kt
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "client.proxy-api")
data class ProxyApiClientProperties(
    val baseUrl: String,
    val username: String,
    val password: String,
)
```

**설정값** (application-outbound.yml):
```yaml
client:
  proxy-api:
    url: ${KEYWORD_ANALYSIS_URL}
    api-key: ${KEYWORD_ANALYSIS_API_KEY}
```

#### B. REST 클라이언트 (KeywordAnalysisClient)

**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/keyword-analyzer/`

```kotlin
// KeywordAnalysisClient.kt - REST API 호출
@Component
class KeywordAnalysisClient(
    @Qualifier("keywordAnalysisRestClient") private val restClient: RestClient,
) {
    fun tokenizeKeyword(
        keyword: String,
        filterStopword: Boolean,
        isExpandSynonym: Boolean,
    ): KeywordAnalysisResponse? {
        val requestBody = KeywordAnalysisRequest(
            text = keyword,
            synonym = isExpandSynonym,
            stopWord = filterStopword,
        )
        return try {
            restClient
                .post()
                .uri("/_analysis-product-name/search-keyword")
                .body(requestBody)
                .retrieve()
                .body(KeywordAnalysisResponse::class.java)
        } catch (e: Exception) {
            log.error(e) { "HTTP Keyword Analysis Exception: ${e.message}" }
            null
        }
    }
}

// KeywordAnalysisConfig.kt - RestClient 설정 (SSL 인증서 검증 비활성화)
@Configuration
class KeywordAnalysisConfig {
    @Bean("keywordAnalysisRestClient")
    fun keywordAnalysisRestClient(properties: KeywordAnalysisClientProperties): RestClient {
        // 자체서명 인증서 허용
        val trustAllCerts = arrayOf<TrustManager>(
            object : X509TrustManager {
                override fun getAcceptedIssuers(): Array<X509Certificate>? = null
                override fun checkClientTrusted(certs: Array<X509Certificate>, authType: String) {}
                override fun checkServerTrusted(certs: Array<X509Certificate>, authType: String) {}
            },
        )

        val sslContext = SSLContext.getInstance("TLS")
        sslContext.init(null, trustAllCerts, SecureRandom())

        val requestFactory = object : SimpleClientHttpRequestFactory() {
            override fun prepareConnection(
                connection: HttpURLConnection,
                httpMethod: String,
            ) {
                if (connection is HttpsURLConnection) {
                    connection.sslSocketFactory = sslContext.socketFactory
                    connection.hostnameVerifier = HostnameVerifier { _, _ -> true }
                }
                super.prepareConnection(connection, httpMethod)
            }
        }.apply {
            setConnectTimeout(properties.connectionTimeout)  // 기본 5초
            setReadTimeout(properties.socketTimeout)         // 기본 5초
        }

        return RestClient.builder()
            .baseUrl(properties.url)
            .requestFactory(requestFactory)
            .defaultHeaders { headers ->
                headers.contentType = MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON
                headers.set("Authorization", "ApiKey ${properties.apiKey}")
            }
            .build()
    }
}

// KeywordAnalysisClientProperties.kt
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "client.keyword-analysis")
data class KeywordAnalysisClientProperties(
    val url: String,
    val apiKey: String,
    val connectionTimeout: Int = 5000,
    val socketTimeout: Int = 5000,
)
```

### 5. 비즈니스 로직 계층에서의 활용

**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/service/ProxyApplicationService.kt`

```kotlin
